## Services
{% for s in services %}
- [{{ s.data.name | safe }}]({{ client.domain }}{{ s.url }}): {{ (s.data.summary or s.data.description) | safe }}
{%- endfor %}

## Service areas
{% for a in collections.areas %}
- [{{ a.data.town | safe }}, {{ a.data.state }}]({{ client.domain }}{{ a.url }})
{%- endfor %}

## About and contact
- [About {{ client.name | safe }}]({{ client.domain }}/about/)
- [Reviews]({{ client.domain }}/reviews/)
- [Contact and free estimates]({{ client.domain }}/contact/): {{ client.phoneFormatted }}{% if client.email %}, {{ client.email }}{% endif %}
{% if posts.length %}
## Blog
{% for p in posts %}{% if loop.index <= 10 %}
- [{{ p.data.title | safe }}]({{ client.domain }}{{ p.url }}){% if p.data.description %}: {{ p.data.description | safe }}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
